commit b84e42b59e3af0c68587e84dfb311af5e9dcfe9c
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 01:36:06 2026 +0000

    Add a committee tasks board with the polytunnel rota
    
    Built from incoming/tasks.csv, per the 12 Nov minutes. Tasks are grouped
    into nobody-on-it-yet, overdue, due by next Thursday and later, with done
    ones folded away; the watering rota (the sheet's two side columns) is its
    own CSV, shown at the top of the page from this week on.
    
    kit/board.py gains a "due" mode and an optional "rota" block for this;
    the events board builds exactly as before.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

